{\"ref\":\"d95\"},\"ref\":\"d95\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2020-05-15\\n---\\nObsessenachs love a good Easter egg and Outlander Season 5 did not disappoint. Here's a look at the 30+ Outlander Easter eggs in the Season 5 finale.\\n\\nNear the beginning of the Outlander TV series, heroine Claire Fraser sees a vase in an Inverness ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.outlandercast.com/2020/05/outlander-easter-eggs.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d96\"},\"ref\":\"d96\",\"snippet\":\" ... Stream it on Apple TV +\\n\\n5 Outlander (2014-Present)\\n\\nYour comment has not been saved\\n\\nOutlander\\n\\n- Release Date\\n\\n- August 9, 2014\\n\\n- Network\\n\\n- Starz\\n\\n- Showrunner\\n\\n- Matthew B. Roberts\\n\\nCast\\n\\n-\\n\\nCaitriona BalfeClaire Randall Fraser\\n\\n-\\n\\nJamie Fraser\\n\\nBased on the novel series, Outlander follows combat nurse Claire Randall from the year ... \",\"title\":\"https://movieweb.com/best-tv-series-adapted-from-famous-novels/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d97\"},\"ref\":\"d97\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Scots do not believe her and take her to Castle Leoch, where Claire searches for a way to return to her own time.\\n\\nThe highlanders of 1743 see Claire as a \\\"Sassenach\\\", or \\\"Outlander\\\", ignorant of Gaelic culture. Her medical skills eventually earn their respect; but the ... \",\"title\":\"https://silhouettescostumes.com/completed-projects/projects-1700s/1745-celtic-traveler-susan-hurlbutt/susan-hurlbutt-1745-traveler-historical-context/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d98\"},\"ref\":\"d98\",\"snippet\":\" ... OUTLANDER is entirely in Claire's viewpoint. DRAGONFLY is mostly Claire, but there are sections in Roger MacKenzie's (third-person) point of view. VOYAGER adds Jamie's voice, DRUMS OF AUTUMN adds Brianna Randall Fraser, and so on. All the viewpoints save Claire's are third-person ... \",\"title\":\"https://dianagabaldon.com/wordpress/resources/faq/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d99\"},\"ref\":\"d99\",\"snippet\":\" ... Whose Story is it — Jamie's or Claire's?\\ndate: 2018-05-15\\n---\\nAmong the many emotional fan debates on Outlander the book series vs. Outlander the STARZ TV show, none raises more ire than if/why Jamie Fraser gets short shrift. Holly Richter-White analyzes why TV ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.outlandercast.com/2018/05/outlander-the-starz-tv-show.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d100\"},\"ref\":\"d100\",\"snippet\":\" ... Outlander without also recommending this beloved book-turned-TV series. Perfect for lovers of historical fantasy and romance, it centres around 20th-century British nurse Claire Randall, who travels back in time to 18th-century Scotland and finds romance and adventure with the handsome Highland warrior Jamie Fraser ... \",\"title\":\"https://bedthreads.com/blogs/journal/best-book-series?srsltid=AfmBOoqJb-_xmIzRJAhgSiXeCcX-s9-Dnl86pjyp86NQiyu8eegT6Wuu\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d101\"},\"ref\":\"d101\",\"snippet\":\" ... of the same name, Outlander centers on Claire Randall (Caitriona Balfe), a former World War II nurse whose happily married life is upended when she time travels back to 1743 Scotland, where she is swept up in a steamy romance with Jamie Fraser (Sam Heughan,) a Scots warrior ... \",\"title\":\"https://time.com/6978603/best-period-dramas/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d102\"},\"ref\":\"d102\",\"snippet\":\" ... Traveling through time doesn't get any sexier than the way Claire Randall (Caitríona Balfe) and Jamie Fraser (Sam Heughan) do it. The series, based on author Diana Gabaldon's Outlander novels, starts in post–World War II Inverness, Scotland. But before long, the clock mysteriously winds back ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/historical-tv-shows-on-netflix\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d103\"},\"ref\":\"d103\",\"snippet\":\" ... outlander\\\" is the translation of the Gaelic \\\"sassenach\\\", and that's what WWII nurse Claire Randall is: not just an outsider but someone out of time. This time-travel romance follows Claire as she is transported back to 1743. Her steamy love affair with Highland warrior Jamie Fraser ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.theshot.com/television/best-tv-shows-one-word-title\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"c39103fa2fca70883f066248e180259ee287636b911fdcdd97ff2b1705b37c80\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"81e294fb255758c4de8a8285e5db045931df361834d7fed83f1abfbcf912fd4b\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Outlander Claire Fraser marriages children survived\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d104\"},\"ref\":\"d104\",\"snippet\":\" ... Breaker of Chains\\nnext: First of His Name\\nseason_article: Game of Thrones season 4\\nepisode_list: List of Ga