]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":9000,\"ref\":\"e2\",\"start\":3000}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the world of The 100.\\n\\nJessica plays Niylah, a character who shows up in ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d40\"},\"ref\":\"d40\",\"snippet\":\" ... as a recurring character in the first season. She is portrayed by starring cast member Lindsey Morgan and debuts in \\\"Earth Skills\\\".\\n\\nWhile on Earth, Raven was the primary mechanic and explosives expert for the Delinquents. Raven is not part of the original the 100, however, she barters ... \",\"title\":\"https://the100.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Reyes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d41\"},\"ref\":\"d41\",\"snippet\":\" ... Moreover, he found himself unable to accept the personality and character of his wife as well as her family and circle of friends. After 20 days of cohabitation their marriage was still not consummated. It is uncertain whether Tchaikovsky had confided in his wife at the outset regarding ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.tchaikovsky-research.net/pages/Antonina_Tchaikovskaya\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d14\"},\"ref\":\"d14\",\"snippet\":\" ... Along with the marriages, the character is also given a number of other love interests. The motivation behind the multiple romances stems from the character's need to fill the void her father left when he abandoned her.\\n\\nAs the series begins, Erica's romantic role is as ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erica_Kane\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... Bell guest-starred on the HBO period drama series Deadwood, in a two-episode story arc (\\\"Bullock Returns to the Camp\\\" and \\\"Suffer the Little Children\\\").\\n\\nAt 24, she won the role of the title character in the UPN noir drama series Veronica Mars, which was launched in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kristen_Bell\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d43\"},\"ref\":\"d43\",\"snippet\":\" ... A character actor with over 100 credits, he was the Doctor on Voyage to the Bottom of the Sea from 1964 to 1968. He later returned to guest roles, including ER, Hill Street Blues and three episodes of Highway to Heaven, which reunited him with Landon. His final ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/little-house-on-the-prairie-cast-where-are-they-now-8603014\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d44\"},\"ref\":\"d44\",\"snippet\":\" ... Supporting Characters\\n\\n*Nana, an ethnic Tajik from a village outside Herat. Initially betrothed to a local boy in her village, Nana's life trajectory greatly changes after \\\"the jinn enters her body\\\" shortly before marriage, causing her to have a seizure. The incident leaves her unmarriageable, and she ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Thousand_Splendid_Suns\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d45\"},\"ref\":\"d45\",\"snippet\":\" ... of the three things a female writer might want — marriage, children, and a successful writing career — she could have two of the three, but not all three. Virginia Woolf — marriage and career. Margaret Laurence — children and career.\\n\\nThese days, of course, there are many examples.\\n\\nThrough the nineties ... \",\"title\":\"https://bethkaplan.ca/2024/07/15/the-writer-as-mother-confronting-alice-munro/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d46\"},\"ref\":\"d46\",\"snippet\":\" ... The analysis is based on the character of Iheoma; a good, respected woman of great beauty and dignity, who brings suffering and death to all her lovers as a result of her spiritual marriage to the jealous sea god. The study concludes that, the supernatural has provided themes ... \",\"title\":\"https://ijellh.com/papers/2014/September/08-89-101-sept-2014.pdf\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d47\"},\"ref\":\"d47\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ihara, a former weather announcer for the Japanese news program \\\"ズームイン!! SUPER\\\" (Zoom In!! Super) is nineteen years Matsumoto's junior, and apparently became pregnant by Matsumoto, prompting the marriage. The announcement of the marriage came via fax by Matsumoto's managing organization to several media outlets, including ... \",\"title\":\"https://aminoapps.com/c/gaki/page/item/matsumoto-hitoshi/D8Ba_ZL2TNIxxNL52LPNM7x4anlz5rkVKeM\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\"